      "description": "At least one of PAD, diabetes mellitus, or lower-extremity wound, on condition_occurrence. WINDOWS ARE PER-INDICATION and were tightened 2026-08-12 from the unbounded window inherited from 1797941: PAD and DM are chronic, so any prior documentation counts and the window runs to +1 year (the amputation admission is frequently where PAD is first formally coded); a wound is an acute episode, so it is bracketed to +/-1 year -- a wound five years earlier is not this amputation's indication."
